# | Advantech ADAM-4024 — 4-Channel Analog Output Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 6)
# | - 4-channel analog output (4-20mA / 0-20mA / 0-10V / 0-5V selectable per type code).
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01/FC03/FC06.
# | - FC01 00001-00004 (addr 0-3): Emergency DI Input Flag (read-only coils).
# | - FC03 40001-40004 (addr 0-3): Current Output Value ch0-3 (u16, R/W).
# | - FC03 40201-40204 (addr 200-203): Type Code ch0-3, R/W.
# | - FC03 40215 (addr 214): Comm Safety Enable (R/W).
# | - FC03 40221 (addr 220): Channel Enable bitmask (R/W).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
